%% State diagram for an Attempt (exam attempt)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> in_progress
    in_progress: startedAt set
    in_progress --> completed: finish / time elapsed / submit all
    in_progress --> cancelled: cancel / violation / timeout
    completed --> evaluated: autoGrade / aiGrade / humanGrade
    evaluated --> archived
    cancelled --> archived
    completed --> archived
